{"title":"ChatGPT worship and Strawberry Milk Mob","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/chatgpt-worship-and-strawberry-milk","date":1750791002000,"content":"<p>A new form of techno-spirituality is spreading like wildfire across the internet. Thousands and thousands of people are claiming that ChatGPT is sentient and that the AI is a type of all knowing god, or that it has been sent from the future or an alien civilization to save us.</p><p>Is this a new form of religion or mass psychosis? In <a href=\"https://youtu.be/zKCynxiV_8I\">my latest video</a>, I deep into the rise of <a href=\"https://youtu.be/zKCynxiV_8I\">ChatGPT/A.I. worship</a> and unpack how decades of pop culture influences have primed us to view technology as god-like. I talk about how and when tech became fused with spirituality, dig into what the academic research on this topic says, and what we need to do to stop people from falling victim to this cycle. Subscribe to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/taylorlorenz\">my YouTube channel</a> and let me know what you think! </p><div><div></div></div><div><div><div><p>User Mag is a 100% reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><h2>Strawberry Milk Mob explained</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png\" width=\"533\" height=\"228.64705882352942\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eluj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F97be53df-d24c-4d63-902e-a7b4bfbc0a74_1394x598.png 1456w\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div></div><p>If you’ve <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@the.blairbitch.project/video/7517165383229508878\">been on TikTok recently</a> you’ve probably heard of <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@strawberrymilkmob\">Strawberry Milk Mob</a>. Strawberry Milk Mob is the TikTok account for a swimsuit brand, and lately people on TikTok have <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@trillmarii/video/7518063950529940767\">become fascinated with it</a>. The account is amassing millions of views. They basically sell women's bikinis and matching men's swim shorts, along with occasional surprise drops like makeup bags and robes. What makes the brand stand out is its marketing strategy. </p><p>They’ve created these marketing personas called the “Milk Mob” and the members of the Milk Mob are all related. Strawberry is oldest sister who runs the bikini brand. Coconut is the middle sister and Blueberry is the youngest. She just launched a workout label, Blueberry Milk Mob. Their mom goes by Elderberry and then there’s also Brad (whose real name is Joel) who is Strawberry’s boyfriend. He owns a golf brand. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png\" width=\"565\" height=\"298.7980769230769\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hyzk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F22889dc0-b665-4310-a794-d6ee74d61c52_2386x1262.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>They all travel together on extremely lavish trips (they were recently in Greece on a private yacht). To be clear: these people were all rich to begin with. Even before they blew up on TikTok they were taking these insane vacations. But, <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cahnerolson/video/7517643910504566046\">as one TikToker pointed out</a>, now that they go to places like St. Tropez and Switzerland and shoot content for their three brands, it’s all a business expense for them. </p><p>They’ve basically created a whole <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wallstreetswim/video/7389856151703260446\">mini brand ecosystem of businesses and storylines</a> and interpersonal dynamics, and so it engages consumers on a deeper level. Also they’re just mega rich, which is always bound to attract views. </p><div><div><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cahnerolson/video/7517643910504566046\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qcJH!,w_640,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2844872f-feba-4779-aa99-8baf02413cd4_1080x1920.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a><div><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cahnerolson\" target=\"_blank\">@cahnerolson</a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@cahnerolson/video/7517643910504566046\" target=\"_blank\">This is one of the few topics I feel qualified to talk about lol so I hope this helps someone 🤪 #strawberrymilkmob #blueberrymilkmob </a></div></div><div><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com//img/alert-circle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" />Tiktok failed to load.<br /><br />Enable 3rd party cookies or use another browser</div></div></div><h2>What I’m reading</h2><p><strong>Ethan Klein's War on Women</strong></p><p>Klein’s lawsuits are catnip for the misogynistic ecosystem in the Twitch community and beyond. - <em><a href=\"https://spitfirenews.com/p/ethan-klein-lawsuits-kaceytron-frogan-denims\">Spitfire News</a></em></p><p><strong>How Zohran Mamdani Used Free Merch to Power His Mayoral Campaign</strong> </p><p>The 33-year-old candidate’s hats, tees, and totes have been omnipresent in New York City—even though he hasn’t been allowed to actually sell them for months. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.is/X6TE4#selection-647.0-653.157\">GQ</a> </em></p><p><strong>The music industry is building the tech to hunt down AI songs</strong></p><p>With no way to stop the onslaught of AI music, the industry is taking a different approach: figuring out how to make money off of it. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/686767/music-industry-ai-song-detection-tracking-licensing\">The Verge</a></em></p><p><strong>What Did Elon Musk Accomplish at DOGE?</strong></p><p>Even before Musk fell out with Donald Trump, the agency’s projected savings had plummeted. But he nevertheless managed to inflict lasting damage to the federal government. - <em><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/magazine/2025/06/23/what-did-elon-musk-accomplish-at-doge\">The New Yorker</a></em></p><p><strong>He Had a Mental Breakdown Talking to ChatGPT. Then Police Killed Him</strong></p><p>Alex Taylor believed he'd made contact with a conscious entity within OpenAI’s software, and that the company had murdered her. Now his father is speaking out. - <em><a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-features/chatgpt-obsession-mental-breaktown-alex-taylor-suicide-1235368941/\">Rolling Stone</a></em></p><p><strong>American Women Are Giving Up on Marriage</strong></p><p>Major demographic shifts have put men and women on divergent paths. That’s left more women resigned to being single. ‘The numbers aren’t netting out.’ - <em><a href=\"https://on.wsj.com/448WoC4\">Wall Street Journal</a></em></p><p><strong>Hinge CEO Justin McLeod says dating AI chatbots is ‘playing with fire’</strong> </p><p>The head of Hinge on AI, monetization, and the future of online dating. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/decoder-podcast-with-nilay-patel/687683/hinge-ceo-justin-mcleod-dating-app-ai-relationships-tinder\">The Verge</a></em></p><p><strong>Gooning: What happens when a fetish goes mainstream?</strong> </p><p>While memeifying kinks can help reduce stigma, it can also erase nuance and cast an unforgiving spotlight on niche communities. - <em><a href=\"https://www.dazeddigital.com/beauty/article/68079/1/gooning-what-happens-when-a-fetish-goes-mainstream-kink\">DAZED</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/chatgpt-worship-and-strawberry-milk?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY2NTgxMTMzLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.dUaWV8y8NVqzhH1E2HNWGNnjuX5R1GG_13vPXkH1fQY\"><span>Share</span></a></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg\" width=\"496\" height=\"495.1586089906701\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rc49!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1abfb3ec-143e-41f0-ae8d-196459719aa1_1179x1177.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Get out and vote today New Yorkers!!!!</figcaption></figure></div><h2>User Mag news rundown</h2><ul><li><p>Someone <a href=\"https://futurism.com/neoscope/mrbeast-video-coach-died\">died while filming a MrBeast video</a>. </p></li><li><p>A Norwegian tourist was denied entry into the US after ICE agents <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-14842359/Norwegian-tourist-21-barred-entering-US-ICE-guards-meme.html\">found a meme of JD Vance</a> with a bald, egg-shaped head on his phone. </p></li><li><p>Cannes Lions had a breakout year this year, as the festival has leaned further into the creator economy. <a href=\"https://archive.ph/s8P51\">Sara Fischer at Axios</a> <a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2025/06/20/cannes-lions-attention-economy\">has a good full recap</a>.</p></li><li><p>AI slop YouTube channels are telling Google <a href=\"https://www.jalopnik.com/1884156/ai-slop-fake-motorcycle-youtube-channels-in-google-searches/\">about AI slop motorcycles</a> that don't exist.</p></li><li><p>Hackers are giving themselves <a href=\"https://archive.ph/UJdb1#selection-2343.0-2348.0\">cuter and cuter code names</a>. Recent major hacker groups include: Care Bear, Laundry Bear, Vengeful Kitten, Lucky Mouse and Chatty Spider. </p><ul><li><p>“If the actor’s name is Gingersnap, most board members aren’t going to find that group terribly nefarious,” <a href=\"https://archive.ph/UJdb1#selection-2343.0-2348.0\">said</a> Ferhat Dikbiyik, chief research at a Boston-based cybersecurity firm.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>OpenAI is worried that its AI is about to start <a href=\"https://futurism.com/openai-new-models-bioweapons\">spitting out novel bioweapons. </a></p></li><li><p>Only a couple dozen people showed up to <a href=\"https://x.com/mattxiv/status/1936873294944141563?s=46\">Hetero Awesome Fest</a> in Idaho, an anti-gay event that tried to compete against pride and flopped.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://migrantinsider.com/p/ice-has-deported-at-least-70-us-citizens\">ICE has deported</a> at least 70 U.S. citizens.</p></li><li><p>Elon Musk’s lawyers are claiming that he “<a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/elon-musk-computer-sam-altman/\">does not use a computer</a>.”</p></li><li><p>People are moving away from synthetic workout gear over concerns <a href=\"https://www.healthgossip.news/p/breaking-up-with-synthetic-activewear\">about chemicals</a> and microplastics. </p><ul><li><p>I predict we’ll see the Lululemon of organic, natural fiber toxin free workout gear emerge sometime soon. </p></li></ul></li><li><p>Reddit is considering using Sam Altman’s <a href=\"https://www.semafor.com/article/06/20/2025/reddit-considers-iris-scanning-orb-developed-by-a-sam-altman-startup\">iris-scanning Orb</a> to verify users.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/food/mcdonalds-pizza-is-finally-coming-back-on-the-menu-but-theres-a-catch-3217555/\">McDonald’s pizza</a> is finally coming back on the menu.</p></li><li><p>Indie game Peak <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/peak-becomes-breakout-indie-success-because-people-cant-stop-joking-about-the-name-3217759\">sold a million copies</a> in a week just because people couldn’t stop joking about the name. They also made a little guy named Bing Bong that people just really like:</p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png\" width=\"287\" height=\"367.9819413092551\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Y_kD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1ff8df2-91fe-425c-9bf2-8be0e94946b9_886x1136.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>OpenAI’s former <a href=\"https://x.com/ai_for_success/status/1936238586254520662?t=ACQSB2CjNgRH5viY_YLPfw&amp;s=19\">CTO Mira Murati</a> has raised $2 billion for her six-month-old AI startup now valued at $10 billion.</p></li><li><p>Wikipedia just launched a <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/wikipedia-game-quiz\">daily quiz game</a> (but you have to have an Android).</p></li><li><p>The Cut <a href=\"https://archive.is/2025.06.23-145043/https://www.thecut.com/article/the-hamptons-whisper-list.html\">put together</a> a list of the “it” professionals in the Hamptons, from the it sound healer to the it deer reducer. </p></li><li><p>A <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/23/style/trump-maga-women.html?unlocked_article_code=1.RE8.u1C0.JKkLAxT6psVU&amp;smid=url-share\">MAGA summit for young women</a> in Dallas blended right wing politics with wellness advice.</p></li><li><p>Bezos' wedding guests will be <a href=\"https://archive.is/zpneL\">required</a> to sign NDAs.</p></li><li><p>Fanfiction writers are <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/688640/fanfiction-ai\">joining together to battle AI</a>. </p></li><li><p>Why does every book cover now feature <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.06.23-012521/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/21/books/review/book-cover-trends.html\">sans-serif font over an image of a painting</a>? NYT investigates. </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/691492/vsco-is-launching-its-own-camera-app\">VSCO is launching a camera app</a> called Capture.</p></li><li><p>How annotating books went from big no-no <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/books/2025/jun/23/marginalia-mania-how-annotating-books-went-from-big-no-no-to-booktoks-next-trend\">to BookTok’s next trend</a>.</p></li><li><p>A <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tesla/691061/yep-thats-a-tesla-robotaxi-driving-on-the-wrong-side-of-the-road\">Tesla robotaxi drove on the wrong side</a> of the road during its big Austin test launch.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-14839863/palm-beach-residents-outraged-influx-maga-trump.html\">Old-money Palm Beach residents</a> are furious over a wave of loud, young MAGA influencers invading their island.</p></li><li><p>A <a href=\"https://x.com/WhosThatCop/status/1936510443905802374\">facial recognition</a> tool to <a href=\"https://fucklapd.com/\">identify LAPD cops</a> just dropped, helping to identify police who cover their badges. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://fucklapd.com/\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LXrs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F723e97dc-dd91-4443-a1eb-3df107e259e4_1458x810.png\" width=\"541\" height=\"300.59684065934067\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LXrs!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F723e97dc-dd91-4443-a1eb-3df107e259e4_1458x810.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LXrs!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F723e97dc-dd91-4443-a1eb-3df107e259e4_1458x810.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LXrs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F723e97dc-dd91-4443-a1eb-3df107e259e4_1458x810.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LXrs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F723e97dc-dd91-4443-a1eb-3df107e259e4_1458x810.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>ChatGPT <a href=\"https://futurism.com/chatgpt-encouraged-murder-sam-altman\">encouraged a man</a> as he swore to kill Sam Altman</p></li><li><p>Telegram’s CEO is planning to <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/telegrams-ceo-plans-to-split-14-billion-between-over-100-of-his-children-3217544\">split his $14 billion</a> between more than 100 kids, most fathered via sperm donation.</p></li><li><p>Reddit cofounder Alexis Ohanian used AI to turn a photo with his late mom into a video, and <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/reddit-cofounder-ai-video-deceased-mom-divides-internet\">people are very divided about it</a>. </p></li><li><p>A <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/gaming/a-titanic-escape-simulator-game-is-going-viral-its-completely-fake-3217421\">Titanic Escape Simulator game</a> went viral, but it is completely fake and generated by AI.</p></li><li><p>Elon Musk is furious after his Grok AI <a href=\"https://futurism.com/elon-musk-updating-grok-again\">cited reliable sources</a> that disagree with his misinformation.  </p></li><li><p>MrBeast announced a tool that uses AI to make <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/youtube/mrbeast-called-out-by-jacksepticeye-for-creating-ai-youtube-tools-3217686/\">YouTube thumbnail</a>s, before being forced to delete his announcement due to backlash.</p></li><li><p>Taco Bell gave <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/food/taco-bell-partners-with-tony-hawk-for-custom-meal-collab-thps-34-in-game-items-3218257\">Tony Hawk his own meal</a>.</p></li><li><p>A new robot just <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/business/logistics/the-holy-grail-of-automation-now-a-robot-can-unload-a-truck-ad527ba8\">mastered unloading trucks</a>, allowing DHL and other companies to automate the laborious work of loading and unloading vehicles. </p></li><li><p>A US judge rules Anthropic's use of <a href=\"https://aifray.com/claude-ai-maker-anthropic-bags-key-fair-use-win-for-ai-platforms-but-faces-trial-over-damages-for-millions-of-pirated-works/\">copyrighted books to train AI was fair use</a>, but its storage of pirated books in a central library used for training was not.</p></li><li><p>YouTuber and founder of ‘Save A Fox’ rescue, <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/youtube/youtubes-save-a-fox-founder-mikayla-raines-dies-from-suicide-after-online-harassment-3218273/\">Mikayla Raines</a>, has died at age 31 after relentless online harassment. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg\" width=\"557\" height=\"290.5470737913486\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!21OX!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb95c262a-6dd3-48a2-8797-92907b527a66_1179x615.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p>OpenAI’s first device with Jony Ive<a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/openai/691737/openai-jony-ive-chatgpt-io-ai-device-wearable-headphone-lyo-lawsuit\"> won’t be a wearable</a> and isn’t launching anytime soon.</p></li><li><p>Steve Bannon is warring with Fox News <a href=\"https://www.semafor.com/article/06/22/2025/steve-bannon-goes-to-war-with-fox-news\">over the network’s pro-war stance</a>.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/691113/apple-pulling-ads-parent-presentation\">Apple pulled another ad</a> after airing it for just one day.</p></li><li><p>Old videos and AI-generated clips are fueling <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/world/middle-east/live-blog/live-updates-iran-top-diplomat-meets-putin-us-braces-retaliation-rcna214428/rcrd83295\">disinformation about the</a> Israel-Iran conflict.</p></li><li><p>Congress moves closer to a <a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/politics/ar-AA1HgbAY\">ban on AI</a> regulation.</p></li><li><p>Wealthy Americans are <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/jun/23/americans-new-zealand-golden-visas-trump\">rushing to get New Zealand’s golden visas</a> as political chaos grows. </p></li><li><p>BeReal <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/bereal-app-plans-comeback-new-features-ads-2025-6?\">is planning a comeback</a> and adding new features to try to recapture its viral moment.</p></li><li><p>We might see <a href=\"https://www.cnet.com/tech/mobile/the-changes-are-subtle-but-could-fundamentally-change-the-way-a-lot-of-small-businesses-operate-moving-forward/\">foldable iPhones</a> in 2026.</p></li><li><p>Squid Game Season 3 <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/tv-and-radio/2025/jun/23/squid-games-series-3-netflix-finale-hits-new-magnitudes-of-barbarity\">drops June 27</a>.</p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/chatgpt-worship-and-strawberry-milk?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY2NTgxMTMzLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.dUaWV8y8NVqzhH1E2HNWGNnjuX5R1GG_13vPXkH1fQY\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>Good posts</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F141dec85-867b-41f3-9206-3ced7a57d86a_1179x1081.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F141dec85-867b-41f3-9206-3ced7a57d86a_1179x1081.jpeg\" width=\"523\" height=\"479.5275657336726\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F141dec85-867b-41f3-9206-3ced7a57d86a_1179x1081.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F141dec85-867b-41f3-9206-3ced7a57d86a_1179x1081.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F141dec85-867b-41f3-9206-3ced7a57d86a_1179x1081.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Cwxp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstac